==Latin==

===Etymology===
From the {{der|la|ine-pro|-}} adverbial root {{m|ine-pro|*ḱa-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*ḱu-||to lighten, burn}}. Compare {{cog|grc|καίω}}, {{cog|sa|श्वस्}} and {{cog|fa|سو|tr=su||light}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|crās}}
* {{rhymes|aːs|lang=la}}

===Adverb===
{{la-adv|crās|-}}

# [[tomorrow]]
#: '''''Crās''' Mārcus lūdōs vidēbit.''
#:: '''Tomorrow''', Marcus will see the games.

